#: Installation.md:1
msgid "Installation advice"
msgstr ""

#: Installation.md:3
msgid ""
"Everything in this tutorial can be performed using PLUMED only. In other "
"words, none of the exercises in this tutorial require you to run an "
"molecular dynamics code and call PLUMED from it. All the molecular dynamics "
"in this tutorial is performed using PLUMED's internal MD code - `simplemd`. "
"You thus only need to install PLUMED using the instructions you can find "
"[here](https://www.plumed-"
"tutorials.org/lessons/20/001/data/NAVIGATION.html)."
msgstr ""

#: Installation.md:8
msgid ""
